# Mock plant

Config file: `reference/mock_plant.json` (`HVACPULSE_PLANT_CONFIG`). Scope is
`demo-tenant` / `mock-factory` / `chiller-plant-1`, version `mock-plant-v1`.
Tag limits and units stay in that file.

Table names and snapshot grain are in the streaming rule. Do not restate them.

```powershell
.\scripts\local\run_local_stack.ps1 -Task plant-all
.\scripts\local\run_local_stack.ps1 -Task plant-cycle -SimulateControl
python -m streaming.jobs.plant_pipeline bootstrap --count 2000
python -m streaming.jobs.plant_pipeline cycle
python -m streaming.jobs.plant_learning train
```

`-SimulateControl` / `--simulate` only ACKs the mock plant. Default is shadow.
Cloud `run_plant.py` rejects simulation.

Training needs ≥96 clean snapshots spanning two days. Approval is untouched-test
CVRMSE ≤ 0.15 and RMSE better than the constant-last-load baseline
(`plant/learning.py`). Do not loosen freshness, model age, interlocks, or
dwell gates to make a demo pass. Runbook: `docs/runbooks/plant-pipeline.md`.
